    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Status of Implementation Progress: No issues

Outputs under electricity reconstruction fully achieved

Classes has resumed in 16 upgraded schools

Removal of asbestos has been completed and transported to Tongatapu for safe disposal in the land fill.

Three additional public buildings including the Ha&apos;apai Court House, public market, and Ministry of Infrastructure&apos;s Garage Shed in Lifuka, damaged during cyclone Ian were also restored using the project savings.</narrative>
    </title>
